== Logical Operators

```zl
and     // Logical AND
or      // Logical OR
not     // Logical NOT
xor     // Logical XOR
nor     // Logical NOR
nand    // Logical NAND
xnor    // Logical XNOR
```

== Bitwise Operators

```zl
&&      // Bitwise AND
||      // Bitwise OR
!!      // Bitwise NOT
^^      // Bitwise XOR
!|      // Bitwise NOR
!&      // Bitwise NAND
!^      // Bitwise XNOR
%%      // Bitwise MOD
<<      // Bitwise LEFT SHIFT
>>      // Bitwise RIGHT SHIFT
```

== Comparison Operators

```zl
=       // Equal
!=      // NOT Equal
&=      // AND Equal
|=      // OR Equal
^=      // XOR Equal
%=      // MOD Equal
<       // Less Than
>       // Greater Than
<=      // Less Than or Equal
>=      // Greater Than or Equal
<<=     // LEFT SHIFT Equal
>>=     // RIGHT SHIFT Equal
```

== Arithmetic Operators

```zl
+       // Addition
-       // Subtraction
*       // Multiplication
/       // Division
%       // Remainder (Modulo)
:       // Range
**      // Exponentiation (Power)
++      // Increment
--      // Decrement
//      // Quotient
()      // Parentheses
```

== Order of Operations

```zl
1 + (2 * 2)
(2 + 2) * (8 / 2) + 10
(4 * 4 / (4 + 4))
```
